#. Key:	E2F17E56431A52F3D9F00A98BB377AA2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/InfoMessages/UMG_WipeInfo.UMG_WipeInfo_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/InfoMessages/UMG_WipeInfo.UMG_WipeInfo_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
